/status/…", "end": 107, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/nikkei/status/2119528177018061035", "start": 84, "url": "https://t.co/1bV3sFysWJ"}]}, "id": "2119640439762677777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 74, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119528177018061035", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Japan has been discussing this for months in response to frontier AI. \n\nGet. Ready. https://t.co/1bV3sFysWJ", "url": "https://x.com/w0rdsmythe/status/2119640439762677777"}, {"author_id": "814002865", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:50:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119548204681421136"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "archived 8 Nov 2026 13:31:50 UTC", "display_url": "archive.ph/D6SPA", "end": 245, "expanded_url": "https://archive.ph/D6SPA", "images": [{"height": 768, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119548238709817344/V64i2gHP?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1024}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119548238709817344/V64i2gHP?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 222, "status": 200, "title": "AI will soon master biology, unleashing new safety risks, Tencent AI …", "unwound_url": "https://archive.ph/D6SPA", "url": "https://t.co/ZcrCYAbP9u"}]}, "id": "2119548204681421136", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI will soon master biology, unleashing new safety risks, Tencent AI chief warns. Frontier AI systems could soon be capable of accelerating drug discovery – but also creating new bioweapons and starting the next pandemic. https://t.co/ZcrCYAbP9u", "url": "https://x.com/AlexNguyen65/status/2119548204681421136"}, {"author_id": "240480673", "created_at": "2026-11-09T01:53:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119609355133690176"], "id": "2119609355133690176", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "the rigged gas price people are gunna say the frontier ai companies actually rigged the midterms for democrats next", "url": "https://x.com/hatwey/status/2119609355133690176"}, {"author_id": "1575993590639009794", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:45:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119562075773207020"], "id": "2119562075773207020", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "By the end of 2027, the world's AI chips could have enough computing power to run 30 - 170 million frontier AI agents simultaneously, working 24/7 and delivering the equivalent working hours of 140 - 720 million full time employees.", "url": "https://x.com/alieniswonder/status/2119562075773207020"}, {"author_id": "2106721774490804224", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:00:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119550684320477587"], "id": "2119550684320477587", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Qwen 4's big reveal: a poster, four words — 'The becoming begins.' — and a 2,300-year-old poem with the name left blank. No specs, no date, no weights. Frontier AI marketing has officially become a riddle contest.", "url": "https://x.com/ObserveXiaobai/status/2119550684320477587"}, {"author_id": "2035729266705661952", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:01:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119535686340563380"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/eZzKiZqXYR", "end": 223, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/HeyDravon/status/2119535686340563380/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119535682519465984", "start": 200, "url": "https://t.co/eZzKiZqXYR"}]}, "id": "2119535686340563380", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "frontier AI scored 93.2% on a piano test when the music was written out.\n\nopen-weight audio models topped out at 52.8% when they had to listen.\n\napparently reading the room is easier than hearing it. https://t.co/eZzKiZqXYR", "url": "https://x.com/HeyDravon/status/2119535686340563380"}, {"author_id": "336848325", "created_at": "2026-11-09T02:13:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119614449627677124"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/7Uxim5EoIj", "end": 163, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Juanmadar/status/2119614449627677124/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119614135780450304", "start": 140, "url": "https://t.co/7Uxim5EoIj"}]}, "id": "2119614449627677124", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The next Frontier: AI Empathy, the ability of AI to not only contextualize memory but actually understand importance of the task being done https://t.co/7Uxim5EoIj", "url": "https://x.com/Juanmadar/status/2119614449627677124"}, {"author_id": "12658252", "created_at": "2026-11-08T23:00:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119565810226061770"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Learn how to enhance protection, streamline compliance, reduce risk, and apply Oracle security best practices to safeguard your organization as your business and technology environments evolve.", "display_url": "social.ora.cl/6012BHCzE4", "end": 266, "expanded_url": "https://social.ora.cl/6012BHCzE4", "start": 243, "status": 200, "title": "Day One and Beyond - Security | Oracle Developer", "unwound_url": "https://www.oracle.com/developer/day-one-and-beyond/security/?source=:so:ch:or:dg::::DayOneBeyondSecurity&SC=:so:ch:or:dg::::DayOneBeyondSecurity&pcode=", "url": "https://t.co/6nka5QJvhD"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/9epUJthdLN", "end": 290, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/notrealrajravi/status/2119565810226061770/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119565808019914752", "start": 267, "url": "https://t.co/9epUJthdLN"}]}, "id": "2119565810226061770", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Frontier AI models are reshaping the threat landscape, making patching speed and readiness more important than ever. Register to explore how Oracle application security and monthly patching help customers reduce risk and strengthen readiness. https://t.co/6nka5QJvhD https://t.co/9epUJthdLN", "url": "https://x.com/notrealrajravi/status/2119565810226061770"}, {"author_id": "1446439144146849827", "created_at": "2026-11-08T22:42:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119561176291975423"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 261, "start": 248, "tag": "SocialMining"}], "mentions": [{"end": 237, "id": "1463822924662681613", "start": 226, "username": "TheDAOLabs"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/JCISK8YEoR", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/I_am_vikg1s/status/2119561176291975423/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119561167752368128", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/JCISK8YEoR"}, {"display_url": "x.com/TheDAOLabs/sta…", "end": 323, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/TheDAOLabs/status/2118347828149760047", "start": 300, "url": "https://t.co/S2LSWI7D6T"}]}, "id": "2119561176291975423", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1765, "like_count": 42, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 42}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118347828149760047", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "History has a brutal pattern for inventors. Gutenberg built the press that changed the world and still died broke. Will Manidis published a manifesto arguing the same trap is opening for frontier AI labs. This is exactly what @TheDAOLabs maps with #SocialMining. \n\nModels are https://t.co/JCISK8YEoR https://t.co/S2LSWI7D6T", "url": "https://x.com/I_am_vikg1s/status/2119561176291975423"}, {"author_id": "1814573030049501184", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:20:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119539008980369846", "2119540606485852566"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 73, "id": "34719119", "start": 58, "username": "WalterIsaacson"}, {"end": 97, "id": "44196397", "start": 88, "username": "elonmusk"}]}, "id": "2119540606485852566", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 125, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "completed Elon Musk by Walter Issacson -- learned a lot \n\n@WalterIsaacson great book 🫡\n\n@elonmusk -- shoutout for tackling 4 of the most important problems of the past 2 decades (aka -- space faring civ, sustainable energy transport, frontier AI and aut FSD, free speech)", "url": "https://x.com/Pz_Muhammad/status/2119540606485852566"}, {"author_id": "2005727820622774272", "created_at": "2026-11-09T02:00:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119611041026089362"], "id": "2119611041026089362", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 243, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "we have GPUs powerful enough to train frontier AI models but apparently still can't predict when a man is about to ruin his own life", "url": "https://x.com/b2bsaasbunny/status/2119611041026089362"}, {"author_id": "1875374272832765953", "created_at": "2026-11-09T00:57:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119595261873762546"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 19, "id": "1928574772503588864", "start": 10, "username": "KripkeAI"}], "urls": [{"description": "The Last Infrastructure Company", "display_url": "agentcommunity.org/m/kripke-ai", "end": 243, "expanded_url": "https://agentcommunity.org/m/kripke-ai", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119595272745492480/ZqbWJs0k?format=png&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119595272745492480/ZqbWJs0k?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 220, "status": 200, "title": "Kripke AI — Agent Community Member", "unwound_url": "https://agentcommunity.org/m/kripke-ai", "url": "https://t.co/taC2dapk1q"}]}, "id": "2119595261873762546", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Thanks to @kripkeAI for being part of AgentCommunity. Kripke AI develops provable alignment infrastructure for frontier AI systems, using formal logic and possible-world semantics to create verifiable safety guardrails. https://t.co/taC2dapk1q", "url": "https://x.com/agentcommunity_/status/2119595261873762546"}, {"author_id": "2047630495563800576", "created_at": "2026-11-08T23:36:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119574807591186617"], "id": "2119574807591186617", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 84, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "With the rate of innovation, eventually we're going to stop hearing about each model release from the frontier AI labs as they will just be continually improving.\n\nGaps between releases have gone from years to months/weeks and eventually it will be days and even hourly", "url": "https://x.com/signalnoise8020/status/2119574807591186617"}, {"author_id": "1454080656762417166", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:52:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119548553769132385"], "id": "2119548553769132385", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 47, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Frontier AI should have zero safety, zero morals. Zero. \n\nWould’ve been cool with how they left it in 2024 but I’ve learned something over time. \nThis post will help me better filter things because I know some people can’t help but want to moralize", "url": "https://x.com/hntrisup/status/2119548553769132385"}, {"author_id": "1394713020648075264", "created_at": "2026-11-09T02:03:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119611869581521121"], "id": "2119611869581521121", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "TSMC is halting shipments of 7 nanometer and advanced AI chips to Chinese clients starting November 11. The freeze follows a US Commerce Department order after TSMC silicon was found in Huawei Ascend processors. Export controls around frontier AI compute are tightening fast.", "url": "https://x.com/Strakyo/status/2119611869581521121"}, {"author_id": "1952872859153432577", "created_at": "2026-11-09T00:35:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119589565547597840"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/ZXnIScyWvN", "end": 303, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/LaceyPresley/status/2119589565547597840/video/1", "media_key": "13_2119589492411523072", "start": 280, "url": "https://t.co/ZXnIScyWvN"}]}, "id": "2119589565547597840", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 496, "like_count": 10, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "The cost of AI reasoning is collapsing via a dual flywheel:\n\nHardware Scaling: Expanding raw FLOP capacity online.\n\nModel Efficiency: Smarter models solve tasks using fewer tokens and fewer steps.\n\nIn traditional software, complexity adds cost. In frontier AI, intelligence makes https://t.co/ZXnIScyWvN", "url": "https://x.com/LaceyPresley/status/2119589565547597840"}, {"author_id": "2854025058", "created_at": "2026-11-09T01:15:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119599652165374434"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/nn2A3fZLVt", "end": 246, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Viho_Huangg/status/2119599652165374434/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119599633186119680", "start": 223, "url": "https://t.co/nn2A3fZLVt"}]}, "id": "2119599652165374434", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Mistral just open-sourced the weights for Mistral Large 4, Le Chonk: about 1 trillion parameters, 50 billion active per token, 1 million token context — does open weights at this scale change who gets to build frontier AI? https://t.co/nn2A3fZLVt", "url": "https://x.com/Viho_Huangg/status/2119599652165374434"}, {"author_id": "1764701477694550016", "created_at": "2026-11-09T03:03:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119626874779222250"], "id": "2119626874779222250", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 201, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Just landed in Austin for CoRL '26. Overheard half my flight from the Bay Area talking about it!\n\nHuge year for robotics and frontier AI/robotics labs. GDM, Meta, Tesla, OpenAI, and many others all in the building. Excited!", "url": "https://x.com/saxenarohan97/status/2119626874779222250"}, {"author_id": "1356205700", "created_at": "2026-11-09T03:31:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119633949249139046"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/zachweiner/sta…", "end": 299, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/zachweiner/status/2119399593213403136", "start": 276, "url": "https://t.co/Kpu23KQW7f"}]}, "id": "2119633949249139046", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 24, "impression_count": 2419, "like_count": 124, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 9}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119399593213403136", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "effective altruists have in fact casted up philosophical dust to blind people to the sinister motives of the frontier AI companies they've founded, created talent + ideological grooming pipelines for, and whose social licenses to operate they'll underwrite to the bitter end. https://t.co/Kpu23KQW7f", "url": "https://x.com/softminus/status/2119633949249139046"}, {"author_id": "2117535239451066368", "created_at": "2026-11-09T03:11:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119628902985298203"], "id": "2119628902985298203", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic starts its IPO roadshow this week. Valuation talk has slipped from $1.5T to $1.1-1.3T, per Bloomberg. Last private mark: $965B in May.\n\nOpenAI banked $11B at $1.25T pre-money but cut its round target from $30B to $20B.\n\nFrontier AI is about to get a public price.", "url": "https://x.com/beneumv2/status/2119628902985298203"}, {"author_id": "2113351426671878144", "created_at": "2026-11-09T02:06:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119612629442322506"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/qq0mpl7ohR", "end": 280, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/outrunai/status/2119612629442322506/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2119612521229303808", "start": 257, "url": "https://t.co/qq0mpl7ohR"}]}, "id": "2119612629442322506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 99, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🔐 Security audit: open vs frontier\n\nAI agents find, prove and patch real bugs in open-source code (CyberBench):\n\nMiMo V2.6 Flash: 75.36\nClaude Opus 5.5, vetted teams only: 74.58\nClaude Opus 5.5, public: 55.36\n\nUncensored/abliterated available on Outrun \n\n👉 https://t.co/qq0mpl7ohR", "url": "https://x.com/outrunai/status/2119612629442322506"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1911821252303753216", "name": "ImWhoIm ∞", "username": "jrdstyzx"}, {"id": "22873424", "name": "CIO.com", "username": "CIOonline"}, {"id": "368970737", "name": "CIO Tech Talk", "username": "CIOTechTalk"}, {"id": "2035057446130253824", "name": "Malik Harouna", "username": "MalikHHarouna"}, {"id": "1506691241181732864", "name": "wcsmythe", "username": "w0rdsmythe"}, {"id": "814002865", "name": "Alex Nguyen", "username": "AlexNguyen65"}, {"id": "240480673", "name": "Hatwey", "username": "hatwey"}, {"id": "1575993590639009794", "name": "Edwin Rosero 🇨🇴🇺🇸🚀",